        "chr_0040_sweetpie_NormalSkill": {
            "Icon": "skillicon/icon_skill_sweetpie_01",
            "Element": "Natural",
            "Name": "\"Really Heavy Bash\"",
            "Desc": "Kay leaps into mid-air for a short power-up, salvages all her <@ba.key>Weapons</>, then unleashes a powerful ground bash with her heavy hammer. The bash deals <@ba.natur>Nature DMG</> (based on her <@ba.key>Hot Edgy Naives</> stacks), applies <#ba.naturalinflict>Nature Infliction</> on enemies within the area of effect, and consumes all <@ba.key>Hot Edgy Naives</> stacks. If Kay consumes 3 <@ba.key>Hot Edgy Naives</> stacks, she also forcibly applies <#ba.burning>Combustion</> on enemies.\n<@ba.info>If ＞ 3 Hot Edgy Naives stacks are consumed, the effects will be the same as those for 3 stacks.</>",
